{"text":"Sixty-six million years later, in a back room at the museum, the old woman hasn't gone home. The bone from North Dakota is on her table, under a lamp. Her colleagues say it has to be a prank. Someone carved it, and someone buried it. But she dug it out herself. It was lying inside a thin line of clay that runs through rock all over the world: the layer the asteroid left behind. The last days of the dinosaurs.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["S","i","x","t","y","-","s","i","x"," ","m","i","l","l","i","o","n"," ","y","e","a","r","s"," ","l","a","t","e","r",","," ","i","n"," ","a"," ","b","a","c","k"," ","r","o","o","m"," ","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","m","u","s","e","u","m",","," ","t","h","e"," ","o","l","d"," ","w","o","m","a","n"," ","h","a","s","n","'","t"," ","g","o","n","e"," ","h","o","m","e","."," ","T","h","e"," ","b","o","n","e"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","N","o","r","t","h"," ","D","a","k","o","t","a"," ","i","s"," ","o","n"," ","h","e","r"," ","t","a","b","l","e",","," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","a"," ","l","a","m","p","."," ","H","e","r"," ","c","o","l","l","e","a","g","u","e","s"," ","s","a","y"," ","i","t"," ","h","a","s"," ","t","o"," ","b","e"," ","a"," ","p","r","a","n","k","."," ","S","o","m","e","o","n","e"," ","c","a","r","v","e","d"," ","i","t",","," ","a","n","d"," ","s","o","m","e","o","n","e"," ","b","u","r","i","e","d"," ","i","t","."," ","B","u","t"," ","s","h","e"," ","d","u","g"," ","i","t"," ","o","u","t"," ","h","e","r","s","e","l","f","."," ","I","t"," ","w","a","s"," ","l","y","i","n","g"," ","i","n","s","i","d","e"," ","a"," ","t","h","i","n"," ","l","i","n","e"," ","o","f"," ","c","l","a","y"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","r","u","n","s"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","r","o","c","k"," ","a","l","l"," ","o","v","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","o","r","l","d",":"," ","t","h","e"," ","l","a","y","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","a","s","t","e","r","o","i","d"," ","l","e","f